      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Jun-23-2015 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Lynn O'Malley Taylor, Clerk: J. Murphy, Court Reporter: Mitch Lyon, CSR #6840.<br>Petitioner Sunderiya Ganbold present in court.<br>Petitioner sworn and examined. <br>Proof of Publication on file.<br><br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name from Sunderiya Ganbold to Alena Sunderiya Ganbold.<br>                <br>Decree Changing Name signed in open court.<br>",
